  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Utv&#xe4;rderingen av st&#xf6;det till utbildningsministeriet 2010-2014  f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrar kvaliteten p&#xe5; genomf&#xf6;randet av Sveriges utvecklingssamarbete i Bolivia. Genom denna kommer man att kunna visa de uppn&#xe5;dda resultaten hittills samt att st&#xe4;rka h&#xe5;llbarheten i uppn&#xe5;dda resultat.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The evaluation of support to the Ministry of Education 2010-2014 improves the quality of implementation of Sweden&apos;s development cooperation in Bolivia. This will enable it to demonstrate the results achieved so far and to strengthen the sustainability of the results achieved.</narrative>
